---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="AI Support Assistant - DataTech Consulting and Contracting"
  description="A fixed-scope AI support assistant for HVAC and plumbing companies from DataTech: answers common questions, captures job details after hours, hands off with a full summary. $5,000 build plus $500/mo support."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="page-title">Your phones do not stop at 5 pm. Your intake should not either.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      DataTech builds a fixed-scope AI support assistant for HVAC and plumbing
      companies. It answers common questions, captures job details after hours
      and on busy days, and hands off to your team with a full summary.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Who it is for</h2>
      <p>
        Owners of HVAC and plumbing companies who miss calls after hours, on
        jobs, and on weekends, and who find out about it the next morning, if
        at all. If your phones roll to voicemail when the team is busy, this
        offer is built for you.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What it does</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Answers the questions customers ask most: services, service area, hours, and pricing basics you approve</li>
        <li>Captures name, address, problem, and urgency, plus photos or links if the customer offers them</li>
        <li>Routes urgent jobs by your rules, and books or requests a callback in your system</li>
        <li>Hands off to a person on anything outside the approved answers. It escalates, it does not guess.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What is included</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Workflow and answer-source setup with your team</li>
        <li>Build and launch of the assistant</li>
        <li>Testing with your real call and message scenarios before it goes live</li>
        <li>Staff handoff guide and a review at day 30</li>
        <li>Monthly support: monitoring, answer updates, and small fixes, for $500/mo</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What is not included</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Dispatch decisions</li>
        <li>Pricing quotes beyond ranges you approve</li>
        <li>Anything in your CRM or field system beyond the agreed connection</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="price-box">
      <p class="amount">$5,000 build + $500/mo support</p>
      <p>
        Fixed scope, stated up front. No discount programs.<br />
        Timeline: scoped on the fit call. Most builds launch in 2-3 weeks from
        kickoff.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2>Built by a team that runs its own systems</h2>
      <p>
        This is built by the same team that runs automation for a Columbus
        rental portfolio and a certified organic food business: systems that
        answer customers, route work, and report to owners every week. We use
        the same approach on DataTech's own intake. You can read those pieces
        on the <a href="/proof/">proof page</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Next step: a 20-minute fit call</h2>
      <p>
        We look at where calls and messages are missed, whether this fixes it,
        and what it would take. If it is not a fit, we say so on the call.
      </p>
      <p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Book a fit call</a></p>
      <p>
        Prefer to write first? Email
        <a href="mailto:charlie@datatech.vip">charlie@datatech.vip</a> or call
        <a href="tel:+16147259599">+1 (614) 725-9599</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
